#Topic:My First C Program

Objective:
To write a C program that prints a message.

Code:
\\\ C Program
    #include <stdio.h>
    int main(){
        printf("Hello\n");
        printf("Nice to meet you");
        return;
    }
\\\ 



Key Learnings:
1. stdio.h provides standard input/output functions.
2. main() is the program's entry point.
3. printf() displays text on the screen.
4. return 0 indicates successful completion.

Practice:
Modify the program to print your name.